    "/api/field/compare": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "field"
        ],
        "summary": "Get Compare",
        "description": "竖直软单调投影的前后对比。**门禁关闭时两张图逐位相同**（夜里无光照）。\n\n这里走 `field_at(y = 该棚的 y)` 而不是 `section_field`：y 恰好撞上某个棚的 y 时\n`field_at` 会短路到该断面（build.py:139-142），两条路径**逐位相等** ——\n第四格画的因此就是第一格那片场。用 `section_field` 也行，但那样\n「两张图必须同源」就只是一句约定，而不是一条可测的性质。",
        "operationId": "get_compare_api_field_compare_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "shed",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "棚号",
              "title": "Shed"
            },
            "description": "棚号"
          },
          {
            "name": "t_index",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "description": "时刻下标",
              "default": 0,
              "title": "T Index"
            },
            "description": "时刻下标"
          },
          {
            "name": "preset",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "网格档位",
              "default": "standard",
              "title": "Preset"
            },
            "description": "网格档位"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": true,
                  "title": "Response Get Compare Api Field Compare Get"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/field/volume": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "field"
        ],
        "summary": "Get Volume",
        "description": "V7 棚体三维温度场：一整卷按 y 切开的二维场。\n\n**逐片调用 `field_at`，一行 R2 的逻辑都不重写**（硬约束 1）。夹住 y 的是哪两个\n断面、怎么按 1/dy 加权、单调投影为什么在混合**之后**施加 —— 全部留在\n`tfield.field.build` 里。这里只做循环与装箱。\n\n不做那个「缓存三个断面、逐片自己混合」的优化（实测能把 1.22 s 压到约 0.06 s）：\n它要复现 `field_at` 的整套调度（可用断面的取用、两端的退化、`Y[lo] == y` 的短路、\n投影施加在混合之后），那是把 R2 实现第二遍 —— 两条路径漂了不报错，\n正是硬约束 1 要防的事。1.22 s 已经够用（规格书 §4.1）。\n\n**参数的合法性全在 `deps.get_pipeline()` 之前判完**：敲错一个参数不该等一次\nfit 才听到「参数不对」，而 fit 要几十秒。`test_拒绝路径不碰管线` 钉着这条。\n\n片数**先算、后判、最后才分配**：`_y_planes` 会按片数建一个数组，\n而 `y_step = 1e-9` 那一步要 144 GB。先分配再判上限的话，参数坏掉时\n用户拿到的不是 400 而是 OOM。`test_片数超限时不去分配那个数组` 钉着这条。",
        "operationId": "get_volume_api_field_volume_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "t_index",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "description": "时刻下标",
              "default": 0,
              "title": "T Index"
            },
            "description": "时刻下标"
          },
          {
            "name": "preset",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "网格档位",
              "default": "standard",
              "title": "Preset"
            },
            "description": "网格档位"
          },
          {
            "name": "monotonic",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "是否施加竖直软单调投影",
              "default": true,
              "title": "Monotonic"
            },
            "description": "是否施加竖直软单调投影"
          },
          {
            "name": "y_step",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "number",
              "description": "沿棚长 y 的切片间隔 / m",
              "default": 0.5,
              "title": "Y Step"
            },
            "description": "沿棚长 y 的切片间隔 / m"
          },
          {
            "name": "y_min",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "number",
              "description": "y 的起点 / m",
              "default": 0.0,
              "title": "Y Min"
            },
            "description": "y 的起点 / m"
          },
          {
            "name": "y_max",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "number",
              "description": "y 的终点 / m",
              "default": 18.0,
              "title": "Y Max"
            },
            "description": "y 的终点 / m"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": true,
                  "title": "Response Get Volume Api Field Volume Get"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
